      "lineNbr": 227,
      "author": {
        "id": 1114730
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-10-27T03:24:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The delay time is for transmitter power stable, please refer to RTD2136_Application_Note(page 6).\nhttps://code.google.com/p/chrome-os-partner/issues/detail?id\u003d44631#c35\n\nIn the doucment, the delay sould be more than 20ms between transmitter power on and I2C communication, and we extend delay time to 50ms for tolerance.",
      "parentUuid": "d6d53101_54622c95",
      "revId": "e35d06a5c390cb10f8db33a647553ca3c5bd1611",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "76d48537_30652647",
        "filename": "board/buddy/panel.c",
