      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-10-26T18:13:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You will call your function every time the AP powers on. Is that necessary? Can you get away with programming once, on EC power-on?",
      "revId": "e35d06a5c390cb10f8db33a647553ca3c5bd1611",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
